# Generated flight artefacts. Everything under results/ that the repository
# ships is committed deliberately and listed in results/README.md; the
# directories below are transient and should not be.
#
# results/latest/ IS committed, and deliberately: it is the reference flight
# every number in docs/RESULTS.md comes from, and `make demo` overwriting it is
# how a change shows up as a diff.
results/local/
results/quick/
results/ci/
results/reproduce/
